{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14946","headline":"奉陪侍中春日过武安君庙 · 卢纶","name":"奉陪侍中春日过武安君庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长裾间貔虎，遗庙盛攀登。\n白羽三千骑，红林一万层。\n元臣达幽契，祝史告明徵。\n抚坐悲今古，瞻容感废兴。\n回风卷藂栢，骤雨湿诸陵。\n倏忽烟花霁，当营看月生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}